"confirmiez la réception. Le commerçant ne le reçoit pas avant."
msgstr ""
"The money stays in escrow with our licensed partner until you confirm "
"receipt. The trader does not receive it before."

#: templates/vitrine/commande.html:75
msgid ""
"Le paiement en ligne n'est pas ouvert en ce moment. Le commerçant vous "
"appellera pour convenir du règlement."
msgstr ""
"Online payment is not open right now. The trader will call you to arrange "
"payment."

#: templates/vitrine/commande.html:84
msgid "Commande enregistrée"
msgstr "Order received"

#: templates/vitrine/commande.html:87
#, python-format
msgid ""
